    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "AIDL HALs register an instance, e.g. IFoo/default, with servicemanager.",
      "narration": "An AIDL HAL registers with a name made from its interface descriptor and an instance, such as IFoo slash default, which VINTF must also declare.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Registration",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 8,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "cpp",
          "text": "AServiceManager_addService(\n    binder,\n    \"android.hardware.foo.IFoo/default\");",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 20,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 16,
          "at": 500,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "hl",
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": "c",
          "at": 3500,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "n",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The same name must appear in the VINTF manifest",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 46,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 12,
          "color": "orange",
          "at": 5000,
          "enter": "fade"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "Lazy HALs start on demand: init declares the interface, and the service exits when unused.",
      "narration": "A lazy HAL is declared with an interface line in its init rc, and starts only when a client asks. When no clients remain, it unregisters and exits.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Lazy HALs",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 8,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "text",
          "text": "service vendor.foo /vendor/bin/foo\n    oneshot\n    disabled\n    interface aidl \\\n      android.hardware.foo.IFoo/default",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 20,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 22,
          "at": 500,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "hl",
